## 7. Monotonicity caveat

The narrowing is NOT a smooth dose-response: Spearman rho between quintile order and the gap = 0.30 (p=0.62); the gap is widest in Q2 and Q4 (-2.7 to -2.9 pp) and Q3 (2.24%) sits above Q4 (1.22%). The "advantage/convergence" signal is concentrated in the single top quintile, i.e. it rests on 203 Black respondents and 7 events.

